#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/capabilities.md:9
msgid "当前派生能力矩阵"
msgstr "Current derived capability matrix"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/capabilities.md:11
msgid ""
"本表由维护工具读取当前 F4 事实、受审路线、四个 Board 包、实际软件装配和生成 face 对应的生产 ops "
"定义生成。它不是另一份配置输入，也不建立编译、执行或实板 资格。声明模式、允许 route 和本次选择分别核对，空列表示没有该类关联。"
msgstr ""
"The maintenance tool derives this table from current F4 facts, reviewed "
"routes, four Board packages, actual software assemblies and production ops "
"definitions associated with generated faces. It is not another configuration"
" input and establishes no compile, execution or physical-board "
"qualification. Check declared modes, allowed routes and current selections "
"separately; an empty column means no association of that kind."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/capabilities.md:15
msgid ""
"生产聚合只包含解析后 scope 为 `production` 的包，当前为 `stm32f4`。 Native 属于显式 host-test "
"fixture，不计入生产 SoC 支持；`scope=reference` 的软件 参考必须显式启用 test "
"support，也不进入生产聚合。其他保留的 vendor SDK 不进入 本表。精确限制见[支持](support.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Production aggregation includes only packages whose resolved scope is "
"`production`, currently `stm32f4`. Native is an explicit host-test fixture "
"and does not count as production SoC support. Software references with "
"`scope=reference` require explicit test support and also remain outside "
"production aggregation. Other retained vendor SDKs do not enter this table. "
"See [support](support.md) for exact limits."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/capabilities.md:26
msgid ""
"从完整仓库根执行，工具按同一原始事实重建表；`--check` 拒绝陈旧内容。修改能力应 先改真实实现、事实与合同回归，再生成此投影，不手工编辑表格行。"
msgstr ""
"Run from the complete repository root. The tool rebuilds the table from the "
"same original facts; `--check` rejects stale output. Change real "
"implementations, facts and contract regressions first, then regenerate this "
"projection rather than editing rows manually."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/capabilities.md:29
msgid "查询与证据"
msgstr "Queries and evidence"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/capabilities.md:31
msgid ""
"选择查询报告精确型号、Board、模式、资源、预算和输入身份，并通过 `provider_package` 记录真实 package 的 "
"ID、family 和 scope。事实与 CMake 输入 使用同一快照身份；工具不从家族 Python 注册表或固定文件名猜来源。查询不运行 "
"新的编译、测试、烧录或测量。默认软件阶段保留 `not_assessed`，不表示历史上从未 执行，也不表示失败。显式查询 reference "
"包仍保留其参考 scope 和未评估的物理状态， 不能升级为生产支持或实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"Selection queries report the exact part, Board, modes, resources, budgets "
"and input identities. `provider_package` records the actual package ID, "
"family and scope. Facts and CMake inputs use the same snapshot identity; the"
" tool does not infer sources from family Python registries or fixed "
"filenames. A query performs no new compilation, tests, flashing or "
"measurements. Software stages default to `not_assessed`, which means neither"
" that they have never run historically nor that they failed. Explicit "
"reference-package queries retain their reference scope and unassessed "
"physical status; they cannot become production support or physical "
"qualification."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/capabilities.md:38
msgid "任何验证关联都必须匹配真实源码、配置、模式、产物和执行scope；不匹配或缺失时保持`not_assessed`。"
msgstr ""
"Every validation association must match actual source, configuration, mode, "
"artifacts and execution scope. Mismatches or missing records remain "
"`not_assessed`."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/capabilities.md:40
msgid ""
"物理 HIL 当前为 `not_executed`，查询不会改变 `physical_qualified=false`。 "
"PCB、供电、跳线、波形、吞吐与时序需要真实 station 原件，软件模型和预算不提供 "
"这些物理结论。资格规则见[验收边界](qualification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Physical HIL is currently `not_executed`; queries do not change "
"`physical_qualified=false`. PCB, power, jumpers, waveforms, throughput and "
"timing need actual station originals. Software models and budgets provide "
"none of these physical conclusions. See the [acceptance "
"boundaries](qualification.md)."

